# Blog drafts — the markdown source and its source images stay local; only
# the compiled output (blogs/<slug>.html, assets/blogs/<slug>/, manifest,
# sitemap) is committed and pushed. See steering/decisions.md D-24.
blogs/*.md
blogs/images/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
*.log

# Local data-collection templates (members/projects/partners CSVs) — may hold personal details
templates/
